        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\ntitle SEQ-02: Xác thực phiên &amp; Khôi phục User (US-016)\nautonumber\nskinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true\nskinparam maxMessageSize 180\nskinparam boxPadding 10\nskinparam participantPadding 12\n\nactor \&quot;Người dùng\&quot; as User\n\nbox \&quot;Frontend (React)\&quot; #F8F9FA\n  boundary \&quot;AppLayout / AuthProvider\&quot; as UI\n  control \&quot;api.js\&quot; as APIClient\nend box\n\nbox \&quot;Backend (Express REST API)\&quot; #EBF3FB\n  control \&quot;requireAuth (Middleware)\&quot; as Middleware\n  control \&quot;authHandler.currentUser\&quot; as Handler\n  entity \&quot;userRepository\&quot; as Repo\nend box\n\nbox \&quot;Database\&quot; #F1F3F5\n  database \&quot;MySQL (users)\&quot; as DB\nend box\n\nUser -&gt; UI: Mở web hoặc ấn F5 tải lại trang\nactivate UI\nUI -&gt; APIClient: get(&#39;/api/auth/me&#39;) (Header: Bearer token)\nactivate APIClient\nAPIClient -&gt; Middleware: GET /api/auth/me (Header: Bearer token)\nactivate Middleware\nMiddleware -&gt; Middleware: jwt.verify(token, JWT_SECRET)\nalt Token hợp lệ\n  Middleware -&gt; Repo: findUserById(payload.sub)\n  activate Repo\n  Repo -&gt; DB: SELECT * FROM users WHERE id = ?\n  activate DB\n  DB --&gt; Repo: user record\n  deactivate DB\n  Repo --&gt; Middleware: user\n  deactivate Repo\n  Middleware -&gt; Middleware: req.user = toPublicUser(user)\n  Middleware -&gt; Handler: next() -&gt; currentUser(req, res)\n  activate Handler\n  Handler --&gt; APIClient: 200 OK { success: true, data: req.user }\n  deactivate Handler\n  APIClient --&gt; UI: Trả về thông tin user\n  UI -&gt; UI: AuthContext set user &amp; ready = true\n  UI --&gt; User: Hiển thị giao diện người dùng\nelse Token hết hạn hoặc không hợp lệ\n  Middleware --&gt; APIClient: 401 Unauthorized { message: \&quot;Chưa đăng nhập.\&quot; }\n  APIClient --&gt; UI: Lỗi 401\n  UI -&gt; UI: localStorage.removeItem(&#39;token&#39;)\n  UI --&gt; User: Điều hướng về màn hình /login\nend\ndeactivate Middleware\ndeactivate APIClient\ndeactivate UI\n@enduml&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="GrW604-UMnvdITbRJcZv-1">
          <mxCell connectable="0" parent="1" style="group;transparentBounds=1;editIcon=1;lockedGroup=0;groupPadding=10;" vertex="1">
