        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\ntitle SEQ-04: Xóa tài khoản BQT (US-015)\nautonumber\nskinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true\nskinparam maxMessageSize 180\nskinparam boxPadding 10\nskinparam participantPadding 12\n\nactor \&quot;Quản trị viên (ADMIN)\&quot; as Admin\n\nbox \&quot;Frontend (React)\&quot; #F8F9FA\n  boundary \&quot;IssueAccountPage\&quot; as UI\n  control \&quot;api.js\&quot; as APIClient\nend box\n\nbox \&quot;Backend (Express REST API)\&quot; #EBF3FB\n  control \&quot;requireAdmin\&quot; as Middleware\n  control \&quot;accountHandler\&quot; as Handler\n  control \&quot;accountService\&quot; as Service\n  entity \&quot;userRepository\&quot; as Repo\nend box\n\nbox \&quot;Database\&quot; #F1F3F5\n  database \&quot;MySQL (users)\&quot; as DB\nend box\n\nAdmin -&gt; UI: Bấm nút \&quot;Xóa\&quot; trên dòng tài khoản (id: 12)\nactivate UI\nUI -&gt; UI: window.confirm(\&quot;Bạn có chắc chắn muốn xóa?\&quot;)\nUI -&gt; APIClient: delete(&#39;/api/accounts/12&#39;)\nactivate APIClient\nAPIClient -&gt; Middleware: DELETE /api/accounts/12 (Bearer AdminJWT)\nactivate Middleware\nMiddleware -&gt; Handler: next() -&gt; removeAccount(req, res)\nactivate Handler\nHandler -&gt; Service: deleteAccount(12, req.user.id)\nactivate Service\nService -&gt; Service: Kiểm tra id !== req.user.id (Không tự xóa chính mình)\nService -&gt; Repo: findUserById(12)\nactivate Repo\nRepo -&gt; DB: SELECT * FROM users WHERE id = 12\nactivate DB\nDB --&gt; Repo: user record (role: &#39;BQT&#39;)\ndeactivate DB\nRepo --&gt; Service: user\ndeactivate Repo\n\nService -&gt; Repo: deleteUserById(12)\nactivate Repo\nRepo -&gt; DB: DELETE FROM users WHERE id = 12\nactivate DB\nDB --&gt; Repo: affectedRows: 1\ndeactivate DB\nRepo --&gt; Service: void\ndeactivate Repo\n\nService --&gt; Handler: void\nHandler --&gt; APIClient: 200 OK { success: true, message: \&quot;Đã xóa tài khoản.\&quot; }\ndeactivate Service\ndeactivate Handler\ndeactivate Middleware\nAPIClient --&gt; UI: Phản hồi thành công 200\nUI -&gt; UI: Loại bỏ tài khoản id: 12 khỏi bảng\nUI --&gt; Admin: Thông báo \&quot;Đã xóa tài khoản thành công.\&quot;\ndeactivate APIClient\ndeactivate UI\n@enduml&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="dX7_aauSkzN81Klo3hZp-1">
