        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\ntitle SEQ-06: Lưu căn hộ và diện tích mới (US-001)\nautonumber\nskinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true\nskinparam maxMessageSize 180\nskinparam boxPadding 10\nskinparam participantPadding 12\n\nactor \&quot;Thành viên BQT\&quot; as User\n\nbox \&quot;Frontend (React)\&quot; #F8F9FA\n  boundary \&quot;HomePage\&quot; as UI\n  control \&quot;api.js\&quot; as APIClient\nend box\n\nbox \&quot;Backend (Express REST API)\&quot; #EBF3FB\n  control \&quot;apartmentHandler\&quot; as Handler\n  control \&quot;apartmentService\&quot; as Service\n  entity \&quot;apartmentRepository\&quot; as Repo\nend box\n\nbox \&quot;Database\&quot; #F1F3F5\n  database \&quot;MySQL (apartments)\&quot; as DB\nend box\n\nUser -&gt; UI: Nhập số phòng (\&quot;050\&quot;), diện tích (60) &amp; bấm \&quot;Lưu\&quot;\nactivate UI\nUI -&gt; APIClient: post(&#39;/api/apartments&#39;, { roomNumber: &#39;050&#39;, area: 60 })\nactivate APIClient\nAPIClient -&gt; Handler: POST /api/apartments (Header: Bearer JWT)\nactivate Handler\nHandler -&gt; Service: saveApartment({ roomNumber: &#39;050&#39;, area: 60 })\nactivate Service\nService -&gt; Service: validateApartmentInput(&#39;050&#39;, 60) (Diện tích &gt; 0)\nService -&gt; Repo: findApartmentByRoomNumber(&#39;050&#39;)\nactivate Repo\nRepo -&gt; DB: SELECT * FROM apartments WHERE room_number = &#39;050&#39;\nactivate DB\nDB --&gt; Repo: null (Chưa có phòng này)\ndeactivate DB\nRepo --&gt; Service: null\ndeactivate Repo\n\nService -&gt; Repo: createApartment({ roomNumber: &#39;050&#39;, area: 60 })\nactivate Repo\nRepo -&gt; DB: INSERT INTO apartments (room_number, area) VALUES (&#39;050&#39;, 60)\nactivate DB\nDB --&gt; Repo: insertId: 5\ndeactivate DB\nRepo --&gt; Service: id: 5\ndeactivate Repo\n\nService -&gt; Repo: findApartmentById(5)\nactivate Repo\nRepo -&gt; DB: SELECT * FROM apartments WHERE id = 5\nactivate DB\nDB --&gt; Repo: apartment record { id: 5, room_number: &#39;050&#39;, area: 60 }\ndeactivate DB\nRepo --&gt; Service: apartment object\ndeactivate Repo\n\nService --&gt; Handler: apartment\nHandler --&gt; APIClient: 201 Created { success: true, data: apartment }\ndeactivate Service\ndeactivate Handler\nAPIClient --&gt; UI: Phản hồi 201 Created\nUI -&gt; UI: Thêm căn hộ \&quot;050 (60 m²)\&quot; vào bảng\nUI -&gt; UI: Reset form nhập liệu về trống\nUI --&gt; User: Thông báo \&quot;Đã lưu căn hộ 050 (60 m²).\&quot;\ndeactivate APIClient\ndeactivate UI\n@enduml&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="YRJwS8V_7LZmNrfVLANe-1">
