        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\ntitle SEQ-07: Xem danh mục căn hộ (US-001)\nautonumber\nskinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true\nskinparam maxMessageSize 180\nskinparam boxPadding 10\nskinparam participantPadding 12\n\nactor \&quot;Thành viên BQT\&quot; as User\n\nbox \&quot;Frontend (React)\&quot; #F8F9FA\n  boundary \&quot;HomePage\&quot; as UI\n  control \&quot;api.js\&quot; as APIClient\nend box\n\nbox \&quot;Backend (Express REST API)\&quot; #EBF3FB\n  control \&quot;apartmentHandler\&quot; as Handler\n  control \&quot;apartmentService\&quot; as Service\n  entity \&quot;apartmentRepository\&quot; as Repo\nend box\n\nbox \&quot;Database\&quot; #F1F3F5\n  database \&quot;MySQL (apartments)\&quot; as DB\nend box\n\nUser -&gt; UI: Truy cập Màn hình chính\nactivate UI\nUI -&gt; APIClient: get(&#39;/api/apartments&#39;)\nactivate APIClient\nAPIClient -&gt; Handler: GET /api/apartments (Header: Bearer JWT)\nactivate Handler\nHandler -&gt; Service: getApartments()\nactivate Service\nService -&gt; Repo: listApartments()\nactivate Repo\nRepo -&gt; DB: SELECT * FROM apartments ORDER BY room_number ASC\nactivate DB\nDB --&gt; Repo: Danh sách các dòng căn hộ\ndeactivate DB\nRepo --&gt; Service: Array of apartments\ndeactivate Repo\nService --&gt; Handler: Array of apartments\nHandler --&gt; APIClient: 200 OK { success: true, data: apartments }\ndeactivate Service\ndeactivate Handler\nAPIClient --&gt; UI: Danh sách căn hộ\nUI -&gt; UI: Render danh mục căn hộ lên bảng\nUI --&gt; User: Hiển thị bảng \&quot;Danh mục căn hộ\&quot;\ndeactivate APIClient\ndeactivate UI\n@enduml&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="t5mNHFkR_UTGwUeuFTS6-1">
