  <diagram id="MG6u1ZUUFkpE34T6J7WP" name="SEQ 08">
    <mxGraphModel dx="2135" dy="1382" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="850" pageHeight="1100" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\ntitle SEQ-08: Thêm chủ hộ / nhân khẩu vào căn hộ (US-002)\nautonumber\nskinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true\nskinparam maxMessageSize 180\nskinparam boxPadding 10\nskinparam participantPadding 12\n\nactor \&quot;Thành viên BQT\&quot; as User\n\nbox \&quot;Frontend (React)\&quot; #F8F9FA\n  boundary \&quot;ResidentsPage\&quot; as UI\n  control \&quot;api.js\&quot; as APIClient\nend box\n\nbox \&quot;Backend (Express REST API)\&quot; #EBF3FB\n  control \&quot;residentHandler\&quot; as Handler\n  control \&quot;residentService\&quot; as Service\n  entity \&quot;residentRepository\&quot; as Repo\nend box\n\nbox \&quot;Database\&quot; #F1F3F5\n  database \&quot;MySQL (households &amp; residents)\&quot; as DB\nend box\n\nUser -&gt; UI: Chọn căn hộ, nhập Họ tên, Ngày sinh, Quan hệ &amp; bấm \&quot;Lưu\&quot;\nactivate UI\nUI -&gt; APIClient: post(&#39;/api/residents&#39;, residentData)\nactivate APIClient\nAPIClient -&gt; Handler: POST /api/residents (Header: Bearer JWT)\nactivate Handler\nHandler -&gt; Service: addResident(input)\nactivate Service\nService -&gt; Service: validateResidentInput(input)\nService -&gt; Repo: createResident(input)\nactivate Repo\n\nRepo -&gt; DB: connection.beginTransaction()\nactivate DB\nRepo -&gt; DB: SELECT id FROM apartments WHERE id = ? FOR UPDATE\nDB --&gt; Repo: apartment exists\nRepo -&gt; DB: SELECT * FROM households WHERE apartment_id = ?\nDB --&gt; Repo: household record\n\nalt Quan hệ là \&quot;Chủ hộ\&quot;\n  Repo -&gt; DB: Kiểm tra household.head_resident_id\n  Repo -&gt; DB: INSERT INTO residents (household_id, full_name, birth_date, relationship_to_head, ...)\n  DB --&gt; Repo: residentId: 101\n  Repo -&gt; DB: UPDATE households SET head_resident_id = 101 WHERE id = household.id\n  Repo -&gt; DB: INSERT INTO residency_events (resident_id, status=&#39;Thường trú&#39;, ...)\nelse Quan hệ là Nhân khẩu khác\n  Repo -&gt; DB: Kiểm tra đã có head_resident_id trước chưa\n  Repo -&gt; DB: INSERT INTO residents (household_id, full_name, birth_date, relationship_to_head, ...)\n  Repo -&gt; DB: INSERT INTO residency_events (resident_id, status=&#39;Thường trú&#39;, ...)\nend\n\nRepo -&gt; DB: connection.commit()\ndeactivate DB\nRepo --&gt; Service: { resident }\ndeactivate Repo\n\nService --&gt; Handler: resident\nHandler --&gt; APIClient: 201 Created { success: true, data: resident }\ndeactivate Service\ndeactivate Handler\nAPIClient --&gt; UI: Phản hồi 201 Created\nUI -&gt; UI: Tải lại bảng danh sách nhân khẩu\nUI --&gt; User: Thông báo \&quot;Thêm cư dân thành công.\&quot;\ndeactivate APIClient\ndeactivate UI\n@enduml&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="UUU0q0kBpRzWjhp_8Zxb-1">
          <mxCell connectable="0" parent="1" style="group;transparentBounds=1;editIcon=1;lockedGroup=0;groupPadding=10;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
